  dialogueLines:
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "Heeey, what\u2019s up!?"
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: im good, hbu?
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: Just taking in everything we went through, what a night!
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "How you feelin\u2019?"
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: fine.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "Ha, short and to the point as always. How\u2019s everything outside of
      the game."
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: eh hows vtubing?
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: just chugging along. Honestly, it can be a lot.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: what? but you get to do so much and you have so much freedom.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "That\u2019s not entirely true, Apo, there\u2019s still a LOT of pressure
      \U0001FAE0"
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: I have to make a new thumbnail for EVERY stream I have. That's like, FIVE
      a week!!
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: ive always wanted to be a vtuber. having an avatar like yours would be
      a dream.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: if you do anything, you should try showing your face instead.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: why?
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: "let the world know how cool you are, of course! It can be difficult to
      hide yourself behind a avatar sometimes, y\u2019know."
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: nah, i think having an avatar is cooler. you should help me make one.
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 1
    text: Maybe after this, we can work on something!
    autoProgress: 0
  - speakerIndex: 0
    text: nice.
    autoProgress: 0
  autoProgressDelay: 1.5
  typingSpeed: 0.05
